etermined by the Employer, of which at least six (6) months must be home health experience within a hospital-based or community based home health agency.","source_heading":"Basic Qualifications","source_subheading":"Experience"},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"preferred","item_text":"Experience in automated clinical information systems preferred.","source_heading":"Preferred Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Knowledge of the nursing process","source_heading":"Basic Qualifications","source_subheading":"Experience"},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"preferred","item_text":"Oncology, hospice or care of terminally ill experience preferred if working within the Hospice Department.","source_heading":"Preferred Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Commitment to Service Orientation","source_heading":"Basic Qualifications","source_subheading":"Experience"},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Effective written and oral communication skills (in English)","source_heading":"Basic Qualifications","source_subheading":"Experience"},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Good interpersonal skills","source_heading":"Basic Qualifications","source_subheading":"Experience"},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Also refer to Position Specifications outlined in the appropriate collective bargaining agreement.","source_heading":"Basic Qualifications","source_subheading":"Experience"},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Provision of Care","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"1. Provides the initial all system nursing assessment prior to the provision of care.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"2. Initiates the plan of care and necessary revisions including obtaining written physician orders for changes.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"3. Provides care and services in accordance with the plan of care.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"4. Performs assessment/data collection in an on-going systematic manner, focusing on physiologic, psychosocial, cultural, spiritual and cognitive status; also nutrition, pain, patient/family education, family involvement and patient advocacy.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"5. Provides ongoing periodic all system assessment of the patient and the patient’s equipment needs.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"6. Initiates preventative and rehabilitative nursing procedure (Home Health).","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"7. Initiates timely discharges based on goals.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"8. Educates and instructs the patient, patient’s family or other staff as required.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"9. Counsels the patient and family in meeting nursing and related needs.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"10. Supervises and teaches LVN’s and HHA’s as required for patient care.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"11. Provides nursing care through all phases of care taking into consideration age and developmental needs.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Documentation and Communication","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"1. Documents all care, interventions and care coordination per law, regulation and agency policy.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"2. Notifies the patient’s attending MD, Podiatrist and other professional persons and responsible staff of significant changes in the patient’s condition in a timely manner.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"3. Assists in coordinating all services provided.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"4. Consults with other health professionals when needed.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Planning, Organizing and Productivity","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"1. Effectively plans and organizes work assignment, manages and sets competitive priorities, and completes work assignments with a minimum of direct supervision per agency policy and within established time frames.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"2. Adheres to the services policy and principles of the Kaiser Permanente Medical Care Program.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"3. Supervises Home Health aides and LVNs according to law, regulation and agency policy.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Professional Behavior","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"1. Behaves in a courteous professional manner with patients, health professionals and maintain patient confidentiality.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"2. Acts as a patient advocate in utilizing Medicare, MediCal, Health Plan and community resources.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"3. Participates in Departmental Quality Assurance activities and Utilization Review activities as requested.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Self-Development","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"1. Selects and attends education programs to keep current in area of practice.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"2. Utilizes new knowledge and skills.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"3. Participates in in-service programs.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"4. Annually prepares realistic professional goals and reviews their progress with Supervisor.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Perform other related duties as necessary.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Supervisory Responsibilities:","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"The job has no supervisory responsibilities.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"qualification","requirement_level":"preferred","item_text":"Computer literate preferred","source_heading":"Preferred Qualifications","source_subheading":null}],"pay":{"salary_min":117.79,"salary_max":139.92,"salary_period":"hour","annual_min":245003.2,"annual_max":291033.6,"annual_comparison":268018.4,"status":"usable","source":"normalized_scalars","source_heading":"","source_text":"","is_hourly_fte":true,"hours_per_unit":null},"published_at":"2026-09-29T15:32:20.847858+00:00"}
